notes.notes:
--Balancing
-Base reinforce increase: +25 -> +25 +0.5%
//Added again after halving the percentage increase that was deleted due to the inflation problem.
//As the character's level increased, it was determined that it was necessary to reduce the difficulty to some extent.

-Pointed Bullet Launcher: muscular power per level -1, blindness tolerance per level +1
-Explosive bullet launcher: energy per level -1, immunity per level +1
//The launcher units Confronting to the infantry and helicopters are too powerful, reduce their main stats.

-[Melatonin] regeneration recovery: 20% + 10% of chemistry -> 25% + 15% of chemistry
//I determined that the amount of regeneration recovery was less than the fatal penalty of stun.

-[Shape Memory] weapon regeneration speed and repair speed increase: 50% -> 30%
//I judged it was too high. We don't want the weapon destruction penalty to be completely eliminated.


--Etc
-Corrected an error in which the description of the tactical circuit [Balance Recovery Calculation] was the same as [Operation Timing Prediction].

-Fixed a problem where some skill icons were not displayed in the key setting menu.

-I have slightly modified the location of the assassin and bleeding specialization in the Avidan area.
//This is to reduce the sudden death phenomenon when passing in the early game.

-Spider web installation basics
Duration reduction on hit: 1s -> 0.6s
//I judged that duration reduction penalty on hit was too high

-strength Reinforcement
Remove physical-HP damage
(Added) When hit, duration reduction decreases by 0.3.
//We made it possible to further reduce the duration reduction penalty on hit, but instead removed the physical damage increase part.

-large Unfolding
Delay increase amount: +50% -> +30%
(Added) Vulnerable to weathering: duration reduced by 2 seconds.
//We judged that the delay was too long and not easy to use, so instead of greatly reducing the amount of delay increase, we also reduced the duration.

-The timing at which minions are regenerated in Resis Subjugation has been displayed with a timer.
//We judged that the difficulty of handling subsequent troops, the core strategy of the Regis Subjugation Battle, was too high due to the unknown timing.
